!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/link/invalid/an-operation-body-naming-a-value-entry-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/link-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §4.1, [TSON-SCHEMA] §4.2"
  description: """
    A response's `body` is a `type_kind` slot, so its name must be a type. `place_order` is an entry of the same
    schema, but a value of `operation`, not a type, and a value entry is a member of no reference over a
    constructor, so `get_order` is refused when the schema links. The http project relies on a payload name being
    judged a member of its kind, whatever else the closure declares under that name.
    """
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
